Sidenib is an independent remake that starts from Todobar.

This product includes software developed by Leonxlnx as Todobar
(https://github.com/Leonxlnx/todobar), Copyright 2026 Leonxlnx, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Sidenib starts from upstream commit
809b0d5857b03b3fec946f227ddaffb70cbe2789, which follows the Todobar v0.1.14
release. The upstream Git history is preserved in this repository.

Changes made for Sidenib, beginning in November 2026, include the product name,
app icon, native app identifier, storage and credential namespaces, default
global shortcuts, repository metadata, and documentation; the compact notch
and card shell with its native window and pointer handling; and the rewritten
Today, Calendar, Lists and Settings views. Changes are recorded in
CHANGELOG.md and in the Git history.

Sidenib is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Todobar project. The Sidenib
name and Peek icon identify this remake only; "Todobar" is used here solely to
describe the origin of the source code.
